Ye cache stampede prevent karta hai. Agar 100 agents same video/transcript maangte hain, theoretically 100 identical upstream calls nahi honge. Current implementation concurrent callers ko same future await karwati hai.

Ye modification definitely keep karni chahiye.

🟢 Circuit breaker bhi kaafi better hua hai

Current build mein health capability-level hai:

InnerTube
 ├── SEARCH       → circuit
 ├── METADATA     → circuit
 └── TRANSCRIPT   → circuit

Ye important hai because agar transcript endpoint fail ho raha hai, iska matlab ye nahi ki search bhi dead hai.

Current implementation mein:

CLOSED → OPEN → HALF_OPEN → CLOSED

state machine hai, with cooldown aur single probe behaviour.

Ye previous concern ka proper solution hai. 👍

