1. 🚨 README latency claims abhi bhi issue hain

README top par abhi bhi:

“Sub-2ms cached responses, sub-200ms fresh searches.”

likha hua hai. (GitHub)

Lekin actual benchmark table:

Fresh search P50 ≈ 1800 ms

Cached search ≈ 1.56 ms

Fresh metadata ≈ 350 ms

Fresh transcript ≈ 1500 ms

In-video retrieval ≈ 10.49 ms (GitHub)

So:

Sub-200ms fresh search claim wrong/misleading hai.

Correct positioning hona chahiye:

~1.8s median fresh search, ~1.5ms cached search

Ye actually respectable hai. Fake-looking claim ki zarurat nahi.

🟡 2. Provider router abhi sequential hai

Ye interesting hai.

Current router:

InnerTube
