yt-dlp
   ↓ fail
Commercial

Search ke liye current code sequentially providers ko try karta hai.

Ye failover ke liye correct hai, but tumhari original requirement thi:

provider super fast hona chahiye.

Parallel racing:

┌→ InnerTube ───┐
Request ──┼→ Provider B ──┼→ validate → winner
          └→ yt-dlp ──────┘

har request par karna bhi ideal nahi hai, because unnecessary load create karega.

Better approach:

Adaptive routing

Healthy + fastest provider
          ↓
      Try first
          ↓
      If timeout
          ↓
   race fallback providers
          ↓
     select winner

So normal requests sequential fastest-known provider, but degraded situations mein hedged/parallel requests.

Ye next build ke liye better optimization hai.

