stdio
http / Streamable HTTP
sse

support karta hai.

Ye good move hai because local MCP clients ke liye stdio aur remote MCP usage ke liye HTTP useful hai.

BUT: public HTTP endpoint ko authentication/rate limiting ke bina expose nahi karna chahiye.

Ye next production-hardening item hai.

