# PHASE 20 — OBSERVABILITY / LOGS

Inspect logs during:

- successful request
- cache hit
- cache miss
- provider failure
- provider fallback
- circuit breaker transition
- transcript failure
- malformed input
- concurrency

Determine whether logs expose enough information to diagnose failures.

Check:

- useful context
- request identity
- provider
- duration
- outcome
- errors
- sensitive information

