; rm -rf /
`whoami`
```

### SSRF-like URLs

```text
http://localhost
http://127.0.0.1
http://169.254.169.254
```

### Malicious-looking YouTube IDs

Verify inputs are treated as data.

Do NOT execute destructive payloads.

