# 🔥 MULTI-AGENT CACHE ISOLATION TEST

Have agents simultaneously issue different requests:

```text
Video A + English
Video A + Hindi
Video A + Spanish
Video B + English
Video B + Hindi
Video C + English
```

At the same time mix:

```text
translated
untranslated
fallback
failed
successful
```

Verify that no result crosses request boundaries.

---

# 🔥 MULTI-AGENT SINGLE-FLIGHT TEST

Have many agents request the exact same resource simultaneously.

Verify upstream call count.

Then repeat with:

- same video / different language
- same video / different translation
- same video / different fallback
- different videos / same language

Confirm that coalescing occurs ONLY when requests are semantically identical.

---

# 🔥 MULTI-AGENT RACE TEST

Create overlapping sequences such as:

```text
Agent 1 → cache miss → request
Agent 2 → cache miss → same request
Agent 3 → clear cache
Agent 4 → same request
Agent 5 → failure
Agent 6 → retry
```

Look for:

- stale data
- corrupted cache
- deadlocks
- missing responses
- incorrect negative cache
- single-flight leaks

