REDIS_PASSWORD=
REDIS_DB=
```

toh OpenCode ko code read karke determine karne do ki project ko kya chahiye.

**Important:** Pehle codebase inspect karna zaroori hai. Ho sakta hai existing Redis implementation already `REDIS_URL` use karti ho.

