# 13. INNER TUBE / SEARCH CORRECTNESS

Audit finding:

Empty search results may incorrectly count as circuit-breaker failures.

Inspect the circuit breaker semantics.

An empty valid search result is NOT equivalent to provider failure.

Correct the classification if needed.

Also verify date filtering behavior across providers.

Do not weaken circuit-breaker protection against genuine failures.

