# 15. YT-DLP TIMEOUT / THREAD SAFETY

Audit warning:

`asyncio.to_thread()` around yt-dlp operations may not have a hard timeout.

Inspect all potentially long-running provider operations.

Implement safe timeout behavior where appropriate.

Requirements:

- prevent indefinite thread occupancy
- preserve provider failover
