### Also

`purge_expired()`:

```text
return 0
```

Redis native TTL se expiry automatically hoti hai, so technically reasonable hai-but interface semantics/documentation clearly define karni chahiye.

### Current architecture

```text
CACHE_BACKEND=sqlite   ← CURRENT DEFAULT
        │
        └── SQLite WAL

CACHE_BACKEND=memory
        │
        └── MemoryCache

CACHE_BACKEND=redis
        │
        └── RedisCache
             │
             └── REDIS_URL
```

So **Redis "missing" nahi hai**.  
**Redis adapter already hai; actual Redis deployment + integration verification + production hardening pending hai.**

